{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id398520596"}, "name":{"label":"WB SUCK"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-27T22:03:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11543245249"}, "title":{"label":"The new update ruined everything!"}, "content":{"label":"This was far and away the best podcast app for years. But this latest update ruined so much of it. \n- if you leave an episode half played for a while, you come back to it and it’s been labeled as played and deleted. Awful. \n- If you delete an episode you’ve completed, it stays there for hours until it actually disappears. \n- the new display is terrible. Used to be able skip forward or back 15 secs via the currently playing at the bottom while you scrolled through other episodes and podcasts. Now you have to actually go into your currently playing episode’s own window to fast forward or rewind. \n- also with the display, it now does this silly thing where it prioritises the episode heading, rather than the play bar. So when you tap on an episode, the play/delete/download etc. function bar opens below the episode but out of sight, so it’s extra scrolling down to utilise those. \n\nThese sound like small nuisances, but it all adds up when you’re trying to quickly do what you need to while driving or walking etc. There’s now a lot of extra taps and scrolls just get to where you want. \n\nNot sure what you were aiming for here guys, but please, go back!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1083120614"}, "name":{"label":"Hard_Times_Served"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-26T19:43:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11539223871"}, "title":{"label":"Update issues"}, "content":{"label":"Have been using Overcast for years because it did its one job well and was easy to use. The sudden update has an overcomplicated UI and has taken away many of the features I relied upon (in terms of search functionality, playlist ordering, and even just ease of navigating podcast ep lists). It’s a real shame!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id153576189"}, "name":{"label":"Wynkel059"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-26T17:14:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11538868128"}, "title":{"label":"I don’t like the new update"}, "content":{"label":"I have been happily using overcast for years but the new update has put in features that make it more difficult to use. I often put on a podcast with the timer feature. This is now buried and I have to click to another screen to get to it. Rather than using the scroll wheel that gave the an exact number of minutes I now can choose from buttons with time. The most annoying is if you was to push the track time forward it is more difficult because the whole track is floating window if you try to drag the track time forward it starts dragging the window down to close it. I then have to wake up properly to do something that I could do while half asleep. Now I am going to have to try other programs which is disappointing since I have all of my previous listen history in Overcast and it was a perfect program until this change.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
